<title>FRANCE: Rouen Dec 1-18 flour exports reached 36,679 T.</title>
<headline>Rouen Dec 1-18 flour exports reached 36,679 T.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen totalled 36,679 tonnes between December 1 and December 18, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 43,000 tonnes in the whole of December 1995.</p>
<p>Some 13,510 tonnes of flour were destined for West Africa, 2,750 tonnes for Lithuania and 20,419 tonnes for Yemen.</p>
<p>In Rouen two ships are currently loading 18,000 tonnes of flour destined for West Africa and Libya.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom 331 4221 5432</p>
